  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Qualtiy and Inclusive Education (EQIE 2.0)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to improve holisitclearning outcomes of boys and girls in primary aschools and non-formal eduation settings with a focus to improve reading and comprehension skills in grade 1-4 and socio-emotional learning capacities. This includes girls and people with disabilities. The project will work to ensure access and retention of out-of-school girls and children with disabilities, eliminate gender disparities in education, and ensure equal access to education for the vulnerable, including persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
